#### e3-0: 復旧の確認(e2 の最後に XE1 Gi3 を no shutdown)
show etherchannel summary | include Po11      Po1(SU)         LACP        Et0/0(P)        Et0/1(P)        
SW1#
ping 192.168.200.3 repeat 5Type escape sequence to abort.
Sending 5, 100-byte ICMP Echos to 192.168.200.3, timeout is 2 seconds:
.!!!!
Success rate is 80 percent (4/5), round-trip min/avg/max = 1/2/3 ms
SW1#
#### e3-1: SW1 の束のメンバを lacp rate fast に
configure terminalEnter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
SW1(config)#
interface range Ethernet0/0 - 1
SW1(config-if-range)#
lacp rate fast
SW1(config-if-range)#
end
SW1#
show lacp internal | include Et0Et0/0         FA      bndl      32768        0x1       0x1     0x1         0x3F  
Et0/1         FA      bndl      32768        0x1       0x1     0x2         0x3F  
SW1#
